.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-UPGRADE-MODELS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-upgrade-models
.Nd re-pull every installed model at its latest tag
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad upgrade-models
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads the list of models installed on the native Ollama daemon and re-pulls
each one, fetching the latest published tag of the same model.
The native daemon must be responding on
.Pa http://127.0.0.1:11434 .
.Pp
If no models are installed, it reports that and exits without error.
The Mac is kept awake for the duration.
A summary of refreshed and failed models is printed at the end; the command
exits non-zero if any model failed to refresh.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad upgrade-models
Re-pull all installed models at their latest tags.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-models 1 ,
.Xr nomad-reset-ollama 1
